    "text": "<p>A point object is moving with a speed <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>v</mi></math> in front of an arrangement of two mirrors as shown in the figure. The magnitude of velocity of the image in mirror <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></math> with respect to the image in mirror <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math> is</p>\r<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/13253_que.JPG\" style=\"width: 250px; height: 105px;\" />",
